flowchart TD
    A([Raw Point Cloud]) --> B[Embedding\nLinear → BN → GELU]
    B --> C[Base Serialization\nZ / Hilbert orders]
    C --> D[LearnedSerialization\nPointSorter MLP]
    D --> D1{cat coord + feat\n→ MLP → sigmoid scores}
    D1 --> D2[argsort → learned_order\nlearned_inverse stored]
    D2 --> D3[OrderingLoss\nlocality + distribution]

    D2 --> E[GridPooling ×4\npropagates sort_scores\nvia segment_csr mean]
    E --> F[Coarsest Scale\nPTv3 Blocks no QuatRPE]
    F --> G1[OrderAwareFusedGridUnpooling\nStage 3→2]

    subgraph OAFGUnpool [OrderAwareFusedGridUnpooling]
      direction TB
      U1[up_proj + pooling_inverse expand] --> U2[Score-Diff Gate\ncat c_scores−f_scores, avg\n→ Linear→GELU→Linear→Sigmoid\n→ multiply feat_up]
      U2 --> U3[down_proj → Shared WNO\nfeat_proj]
      U3 --> U4{fusion mode}
      U4 -- concat --> U5[proj_concat\nLinear → LN]
      U4 -- add --> U6[scalar gate·σ\nfeat + gate·feat_no]
    end

    G1 --> H1[PTv3 Decoder Blocks\nstandard Block no QuatRPE]
    H1 --> G2[OrderAwareFusedGridUnpooling\nStage 2→1]
    G2 --> H2[PTv3 Decoder Blocks]
    H2 --> G3[OrderAwareFusedGridUnpooling\nStage 1→0]
    G3 --> H3[PTv3 Decoder Blocks]
    H3 --> I[Output Projection]
    I --> K([Seg Head → Classes])